city` or `angular_velocity` in `integrate_forces` will wake up the `PhysicsDirectBodyState3D`.\r\nBecause of this, syncing the `RigidBody3D` and `PhysicsDirectBodyState3D` sleep value after `_integrate_forces` will trigger a `sleeping_state_changed` signal for any assignment, even if the new value is below the sleep threshold.\r\n\r\nMy solution is to add a check in the setter like it is the case for other properties. \r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, fixes: #108656*","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-23T09:36:04Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T18:27:14Z","closed_at":"2026-05-08T18:20:55Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8e9f83387f4daa64791a15031a1e0600c28244cc","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"M-Boyo:rigidBody-sleep-forces","ref":"rigidBody-sleep-forces","repo":{"id":1142705500,"node_id":"R_kgDORBxNXA","name":"godot","full_name":"M-Boyo/godot","owner":{"login":"M-Boyo","id":115986902,"node_id":"U_kgDOBunR1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11598